 ing technique\, and create your own artwork to take home. No experience is
  needed\, and all materials are provided.\n\nSGVCC will also be introducin
 g their **New Fall Classes\, After-School Enrichment Programs\, Creative T
 ry-Outs\, and the Figure Drawing Studio**.\n\nThe **Maker Space Opening** 
