 an adult. Suggested donation: $25 per person\, with all proceeds supporti
 ng the Community Center’s arts programming. Light refreshments will be s
 erved.\n\nCome get creative\, explore the new space\, and discover what’
 s ahead at the Maker Space! We hope to see you at the Center soon!\n\nQues
 tions? Contact: dfogel@sgvcc.org
