DESCRIPTION:Come support local makers at this fun-filled\, FREE event!\n\n
 **🍂 Enchanted Harvest Market**\n\n**Presented by Griffo Distillery & Tr
 ellus Marketplace**\n\nStep into the magic of the season at Griffo Distill
 ery for the **Enchanted Harvest Market**\, where local creativity\, live m
 usic\, and harvest-season charm come together for an afternoon of communit
 y.\n\nThis FREE festive\, all-ages event features an eclectic lineup of lo
 cal makers\, unique handmade treasures\, delicious treats\, live music\, a
  pet costume contest\, and more!\n\nWander the market\, sip one of Griffo'
 s spirited fall cocktails\, and soak up the magic of the season. Whether y
 ou're hunting for one-of-a-kind gifts\, enjoying an afternoon of music\, o
 r showing off your four-legged friend's Halloween-worthy look\, there's so
 mething for everyone.\n\n🍁**What's Happening: Enchanted Harvest Market*
 *\n\n**When: Saturday\, October 17 | 2–7 PM**\n\n**Where: Griffo Distill
 ery | Petaluma\, CA**\n\n**Please RSVP for this FREE\, All Ages Event.**\n
 \n**✨ Some of your featured makers include:**\n\n**Hippie Hula Candle Co
 .** — Candles and aromatic finds\n\n**Thunder Buddy Ranch Silver** — S
 ilver jewelry and accessories\n\n**River and Vine Studio** — Artful\, cr
 eative goods\n\n**Sonoma Chocolatiers** — Chocolate and sweet treats\n\n
 **Technicolor Dino** — Colorful\, imaginative creations\n\n**Botanica Es
 sentia** \\-- Luxury Skincare\n\n**🎶 The Magic Doesn't Stop There**\n\n
 **Live Music** — Enjoy the sounds of the season while you explore.\n\n**
 Pet Costume Contest** — Bring your best-dressed furry friends for a litt
 le friendly competition and plenty of cuteness.\n\n**Craft Cocktails & Mor
 e** — Enjoy the Griffo experience while spending an afternoon with frien
 ds\, family\, and fellow market lovers.\n\nGather your favorite people\, d
 ress for the season\, and come ready to explore. From handmade treasures t
 o furry little fashion icons\, the Enchanted Harvest Market is where autum
 n magic meets local love.\n\n**Come for the market. Stay for the music. Le
 ave Enchanted!**
LOCATION:Griffo Distillery
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/griffo-trellus-present-enchanted-harvest-
 market-tickets-2003310488599?aff=ebdssbdestsearch
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
