DESCRIPTION:Harvest is drawing to a close\, and there’s no better time t
 o experience the culmination of the season at Somerston Estate. Join us fo
 r an unforgettable afternoon featuring a seasonal lunch expertly paired wi
 th estate wines\, all set against the stunning backdrop of our vineyards a
 s another remarkable vintage nears completion.\n\nExecutive Winemaker Cody
  Hurd will join us to reflect on the season’s triumphs and challenges\, 
 sharing insights from the harvest along with a special harvest-inspired ex
 perience exclusive to the day. From the final fruit coming in to stories f
 rom the cellar\, this is a rare opportunity to connect with the people and
  passion behind every bottle.\n\nRaise a glass to another extraordinary ha
 rvest while enjoying exceptional food\, world-class wines\, and the unpara
 lleled beauty of Somerston Estate.
