DESCRIPTION:This special edition of Stand Up for Democracy transitions our
  collective presence into active voter mobilization. We are bringing our V
 allejo and Benicia community together to encourage early voting\, help nei
 ghbors make a concrete plan to cast their ballots\, and ensure everyone ha
 s nonpartisan resources to understand their choices.\n\nA core principle b
 ehind all No Kings events is a commitment to nonviolent action. We expect 
 all participants to seek to de-escalate any potential confrontation with t
 hose who disagree with our values and to act lawfully at these events. Wea
 pons of any kind\, including those legally permitted\, should not be broug
 ht to events.
