 sic for over 27 years. During this time he has had multiple collaborative 
 producers groups\, performed around the globe\, shared countless Ecstatic 
 Dance and Festival Sets\, Co-developed Motiv Music\, his music production 
 business and Ecstatic Dance Melbourne.\n\nHis artist intention is to creat
 e transformative music that empowers\, moves emotion and creates connectio
 n. His multicultural ingenious influences and diverse electronic music gen
 res take the listener on a journey throughout planetary cultures and beyon
 d.\n\nTo create this\, Temple Step collaborates with sacred world musician
 s\, vocalists and neo shamans from around the globe including Deya Dova\, 
 Desert Dwellers\, Kalya Scintilla\, Nessi Gomes\, Darpan\, Tahir Qawwal\, 
 Peruquois\, Dysphemic\, Ganga Giri\, Murray Kyle\, Kaliash Kokopelli\, Rai
 o\, Dakini and Joony Joon.\n\nFor booking and inquiries please contact:\n\
 ntemplestepmanagement@gmail.com
