BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Witching Hour Halloween POLE Showcase at Bastet
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T210000
UID:2610128Gu8zN3u1UiUTh3qcxYGYw
DESCRIPTION:The veil is thin. The lights are low. Step into that quiet win
 dow of the night when the veil between worlds thins and magic reaches its 
 peak. ✨\n\nThis Halloween\, Bastet Dance invites you into The Witching 
 Hour\, an 18\\+ evening of pole dance\, darkness\, mist\, and magic. Fe
