 n \\(meet at Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\\).\n\nSun. Nov. 15 – Sonoma Rid
 ge in Sonoma Developmental Center/Jack London. 9.67 miles\, 2\,126 ft. ele
 vation \\(meet at the intersection of Arnold Dr. and Harney Rd.\, inside t
 he SDC\\).\n\nSat.  Nov. 21 – "The Big Loop" at Sugarloaf. 7.37 miles\,
