BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Careless Whisper
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T210000
UID:260910lwfUm0SAl0-E4W2noiSstA
DESCRIPTION:Careless Whisper: 1980s Live brings the MTV and Sunset Strip 
 ’80s party to life with high-energy hits\, wild costumes\, rad choreogra
 phy\, and nonstop audience participation. With a glam rock aesthetic and a
  setlist packed with the decade’s biggest anthems\, every show is a neon
 -soaked trip back to the most fun era in music.\n\nWhether it's the iconic
  tunes of George Michael and Bon Jovi\, the dance-pop anthems of Whitney H
 ouston\, or the rock ballads of Journey\, Careless Whisper transports back
  to feeling alive in 1985!\n\nGet ready to dance\, sing\, and relive the m
 agic of the 1980s with Careless Whisper – Where the audience doesn't jus
 t watch the show\, they are IN the show!\n\nhttps://www.carelesswhisper80s
 .com\n\nStep into a night of pure 80s electricity as Careless Whisper brin
 gs their high-energy tribute show to Vintage Space on February 21. This ba
 nd doesn’t just cover the decade. They recreate it. Expect the sound of 
 Duran Duran\, Madonna\, Journey and other legends delivered with the kind 
 of precision and swagger that made the era unforgettable.\n\nThe music is 
 only half the ride. Careless Whisper leans all the way in with vibrant war
 drobes\, bold visuals and a light show that turns the room into an 80s day
 dream. It is a full throttle celebration of the culture\, the color and th
 e spirit that shaped a generation.\n\nWhether you lived it the first time 
 or you have only heard the stories\, this is your chance to step inside th
 e decade for one night of dancing\, singing and unapologetic fun.\n\nDOORS
 : 8PM\n\nSHOW: 9PM\n\nAGES: 21\\+
