 ndidates! See our ballot measures and voting messaging at  SD350.org/vote\
 n\nWhat to bring:\n\nWater\n\nSunscreen\, a hat and comfortable walking sh
 oes\n\nFully charged phone\n\nYour SD350 t-shirt \\(or a shirt without a c
 andidate or political message\\)\n\nTickets:  .
