BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HowellDevine Brings "Strange Time Blues" to Rancho Nicasio
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T190000
UID:261003TpKUfrgFE0SIXQeTd1B_Pw
DESCRIPTION:***“There is no blues band performing today as different as 
 HowellDevine—nor as delightful.”***\n\n**~ Lee Hildebrand\, Living Blu
 es Magazine/SF Chronicle**\n\n***"...just when it seems like all the \\[bl
 ues\\] permutations have been heard and it might be time to hang it up\, a
  trio like HowellDevine shows that in reality the road is endless..."   
       ~ Bill Bentley\, Author\; Concord Music Group***\n\n***"HowellDe
 vine plays The Music with the original feel\, intent and spirit\, and you 
 can tell they love the music while delivering some real blues in their own
  way. The singing and playing is never strained and they play with easy co
 nfidence...they don’t have to prove anything.  There’s tasty slide\, 
 harp and rhythm with relaxed vocals that all blend together for a wonderfu
 lly satisfying experience...it knocks me out to hear a group playing such 
 good quality blues today."  ~ Charlie Musselwhite***\n\n***"What a pleasu
 re to find a young band that really gets the blues...Deep and true to the 
 roots." ~ Bonnie Raitt***\n\nTriple threat talent\, Joshua Howell (guitar\
 , harmonica\, vocals)\, veteran upright bassist\, Joe Kyle Jr.\, and the d
 ynamic J. Hansen on drums mix rural blues with wildly syncopated rhythms t
 o create a rollicking sound that stands in stark contrast to the typical b
 lues heard these days. Originally formed by Joshua Howell and drummer Pete
  Devine\, the band’s signature sound grew from their deeply shared rhyth
 mic sensibility. The band was the first blues act signed by Chris Strachwi
 tz to his legendary Arhoolie Records label in over 27 years\, a testament 
 to HowellDevine’s ability breathe life back into the early blues with th
 eir stamp of propulsive\, hypnotic rhythms.
LOCATION:Rancho Nicasio
URL:https://ci.ovationtix.com/35892/performance/11867048
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
