DESCRIPTION:Come get a little weird\, a little playful\, and completely un
 censored.\n\nUncovered Collage is an adults-only collage-making experience
  using an intentionally provocative collection of source materials\, inclu
 ding vintage erotica\, nude imagery\, adult magazines\, photographs\, adve
 rtisements\, and other found materials.\n\nAll collage materials are provi
 ded\, so just bring yourself and your imagination. No art experience neces
 sary. Cut\, tear\, layer\, rearrange\, obscure\, reveal\, and create somet
 hing entirely your own.\n\nThis is a space to explore the body\, desire\, 
 humor\, intimacy\, identity\, and whatever else emerges when we stop worry
 ing about making “appropriate” art.\n\nAll materials included. 18\\+ o
 nly.\n\nCome make something beautiful\, strange\, sexy\, funny\, uncomfort
 able\, or all of the above.
LOCATION:Autonomous Gallery
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/uncovered-collage/20033
 143/2026-10-20T18
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
