 us an amuse-bouche\, inspired by the flavors of Northern California. From 
 tenderloin tartare to seared medallions\, each dish brings something diffe
 rent to the table alongside our Chardonnay\, Tempranillo\, Mountain Cuvée
 \, and Cabernet Sauvignon. \n\nPull up a chair\, share a glass with Jeff\,
  and settle in for a delicious evening. \n\n$139 per person\, including wi
 ne pairings. Tax and gratuity additional. \n\nReserve Your Table
