BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sound Healing with Horses
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261022T183000
UID:261008HUjMnPlkUUa1lybTQoEdFg
DESCRIPTION:Sound Healing with Horses\n\nAs the sun begins to set over the
  ranch\, join us for a peaceful evening of sound healing in the presence o
 f the horses.\n\nThis unique experience invites you to slow down\, breathe
  deeply\, and receive the calming medicine of sound while surrounded by th
 e quiet wisdom of these remarkable animals. As crystal singing bowls\, chi
 mes\, and other healing instruments fill the space\, the horses will be fr
 ee to interact naturally\, offering their own gentle presence and energy t
 hroughout the experience.\n\nWhether you're seeking relaxation\, emotional
  renewal\, or simply a chance to reconnect with yourself and nature\, this
  evening offers a beautiful opportunity to unwind and experience healing i
 n a truly unique setting.\n\nNo experience is necessary\, simply come with
  an open heart.\n\nWhat to Bring\n\nClosed-toe shoes\n\nComfortable clothi
 ng for the weather\n\nYoga Mat\, Blanket & Pillow \\(if desired\, for extr
 a comfort\\)\n\nWater bottle\n\nAll participants will be required to sign 
 a liability release form upon arrival \\(if you haven't already been on t
 he property\\).\n\nMeet & greet the horses afterward and enjoy some hot te
 a!\n\nMORE DETAIL TO NOTE\n\nSpace is limited to help create an intimate a
 nd peaceful experience.\n\nSince this will be a chillier time of year\, th
 e experience will be held in the stables with the horses. There will be mi
 ni horses roaming in the experience for some closer contact.\n\nThursday\,
  October 22\, 2026 \\*\\*Arrive by 4:40-4:45PM to set up your area on the 
 floor.\n\nStarts 5:00 PM Belos Cavalos 687 Campagna Lane Kenwood\, CA 9545
 2\n\n$65-75 per person 45-minute experience\n\n\\*\\*Tickets are non-refun
 dable\, but can be transferred if notified enough in advance.\n\nSound Hea
 ler: Chris Young-Ginzburg of Grove Circle Healing\n\nwww.grovecirclehealin
 g.com\n\ngrovecirclehealing@gmail.com
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1993872882465?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
