 the gritty\, real-world rock-n-roll storytelling that Bruce Springsteen ma
 de so famous\, and then add a dash of the political activism embodied by W
 oody Guthrie and Pete Seeger\, you’ll have Irish singer-songwriter Pat B
 yrne”\n\n— Folk Alley at the 30a Songwriters festival\,
