UID:261016lPHAdjjZmkewuRckmrc63Q
DESCRIPTION:Price: Adult $10\, Senior/Full Time Student $5 \\(Plus a $2 p 
 er ticket service Charge Online\\)\n\nTicket Info:\n\nSponsor: Marin Cente
 r\n\nLink: http://www.marincounty.org/depts/cu\n\nThe Frank Lloyd Wright-d
 esigned Marin County Civic Center is a national- and state-designated hist
 oric landmark. Ninety minute docent-led tours of the Civic Center are offe
 red every Wednesday and Friday at 10:30 am\, leaving from the second floor
  Café\, Room 233. The cost is $10 adults and $5 seniors and students. No 
 reservations are required. Groups of ten or more can arrange a private doc
 ent tour by calling the Visitor Services Office at \\(415\\) 473-3762.
LOCATION:Civic Center
URL:http://www.marincounty.org/depts/cu
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Misalliance
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T221500
UID:261015kyA4SzAChUyHos2vNx9rUQ
DESCRIPTION:Misalliance is one of George Bernard Shaw’s most spirited an
 d surprising comedies. Set in the drawing room of a prosperous English fam
 ily on a seemingly ordinary afternoon\, the tranquility is shattered when 
 an airplane literally crashes into their greenhouse\, introducing a bold\,
  unconventional aviatrix into the midst of polite society. As suitors circ
 le\, secrets surface\, and romantic expectations unravel\, Shaw turns the 
 traditional courtship comedy on its head with sharp wit and deliciously ta
 ngled misunderstandings.
LOCATION:6th Street Playhouse
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1386143437005228/1386143467005225/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
