 getic lyrics.\, Eyes Out Channels the chaos and misery of modern life into
  their own unconventional crossover style.  Formed in 2019 Eyes out releas
 ed their first EP  "Back From The Abyss" in 2022. After a few lineup chang
 es they began writing new songs in January 2025 which would eventually bec
 ome the tracks on their first length album "Satiate The Blade".  Satiate T
 he Blade was released on June 12\, 2026 on HPGD Productions. Eyes Out plan
 s on touring the world and sharing their crossover music with everyone.
