UID:261004UEPzvWuTN0ivuUx3hRr9gA
DESCRIPTION:Here’s what awaits you this Halloween at Charlie’s Acres!\
 n\nJoin us for a day of festive fun\, sweet treats\, and unforgettable mom
 ents with our animal residents. Costumes are welcome at our annual Hallowe
 en Celebration!\n\n-Treat the Animals: Take a spooky stroll around the san
 ctuary loop in costume and hand out treats to our friendly animal resident
 s while learning their rescue stories.\n\n-Scavenger Hunt Adventure: Kids 
 can explore the sanctuary\, search for clues\, and discover fun animal fac
 ts along the way.\n\n-Pumpkin Smash for the Pigs: Help us smash pumpkins a
 nd watch the pigs bob for apples — it’s always a crowd favorite!\n\n-V
 egan Treats & Goodies: Enjoy a candy treat bag and other goodies.\n\n-Crue
 lty-Free Carnival Food: Treat yourself to plant-based carnival food for pu
 rchase from Vegan Circus Food Truck\, including a special 'chicken' sandwi
 ch sponsored by Daring.\n\n-Games & Crafts Galore: Play fun games and deco
 rate your very own wooden pumpkin to take home.\n\nWe'll be hosting this e
 vent rain or shine! Proceeds from this event benefit the lifelong care of 
 our 150 rescued animal residents\, humane education programs for schools\,
  and emergency response. Charlie's Acres provides a sanctuary for rescued 
 farmed animals\, fostering compassion and appreciation for these intellige
 nt beings through education while empowering people to make kinder\, more 
 sustainable choices.\n\nEntry times every 15 minutes between 11:00 am and 
 12:00 pm! Tickets are limited\; get yours today at charliesacres.org!
LOCATION:Charlie's Acres Farm Sanctuary
URL:https://www.charliesacres.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
