UID:261012wu1huBUWUk2hpPpR__cMmQ
DESCRIPTION:Chico Chi \\(he/they\\) is a queer and non-binary transmasculi
 ne DJ\, producer\, and proud uncle. He currently splits his time between M
 innesota and California\, DJing parties\, weddings\, private events of all
  kinds\, and baby raves. Chi started their DJ journey while organizing eve
 nts for queer and transgender people of color in the Bay Area with Hunnies
  & Hot Sauce. He is also the co-founder of the music & creative production
  house Tender Bois Club and one of the resident DJs and organizers of Take
  Flight\, a global music party based in the Twin Cities. Chico\, which mea
 ns boy in Spanish\, is an ode to Chi’s trans identity and Chinese-Cuban 
 roots. From the clubs to private event spaces to now baby raves\, this hyp
 henated identity influences Chi’s eclectic song selection\, bringing the
 ir multi-genre vibes everywhere they go and leaving listeners pleasantly s
 urprised and wanting more!
LOCATION:Springstowne Library
