DESCRIPTION:BLS Certification Class \\(AHA\\) - In Person\, Instructor-Led
 \n\nAmerican Heart Association BLS certification class \\(in-person\, inst
 ructor-led class in our Rohnert Park classroom\\). BLS \\(Basic Life Suppo
 rt\\) is the required CPR class for healthcare providers. Includes cardiac
  and respiratory arrest management\, CPR\, AED use\, and choking treatment
  for all ages. This class is appropriate for initial BLS or BLS renewal.\n
 \nVive CPR is an American Heart Association \\(AHA\\) Training Site. AHA "
 BLS Provider" certifications are issued on the same day.\n\nWe also offer 
 Blended Learning BLS certification courses \\(online course plus in-person
  Skills Session\\).\n\nLearn from a top-rated\, local CPR training company
  with over 1\,000 5-star reviews! Our classes are fun\, engaging\, and exp
 ertly taught by experienced first responders.\n\nLearn More & Enroll: http
 s://vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification/\n\nQuestions? Call/text \\(707\\)
  612-3277 or https://vivecpr.com/contact
LOCATION:Vive CPR
URL:https://vivecpr.com/class/bls-certification
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raw & Rogue
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T210000
UID:260912coUzCd6duEW9AHBL9A2b-Q
DESCRIPTION:For three Tuesdays this fall\, Raw \\+ Rogue brings an intimat
 e twelve-seat omakase experience to the rooftop of Appellation Healdsburg.
  Across twelve courses\, Chef Willer Larreal Perez—a Venezuela-born chef
  trained at omakase counters in Los Angeles and Miami—builds each dish a
 round the fish\, taking guests on a scenic culinary journey from the count
 er to the plate. An amuse opens the experience and dessert brings it to a 
 close\, while wine pairings from Baron Ziegler\, co-founder of Healdsburg
 ’s Banshee Wines and founder of Marine Layer\, move alongside the menu. 
 Each course is paired with its own song\, creating a soundtrack that build
 s plate by plate as the light shifts over Northern Sonoma County. Together
 \, the food\, wine and music create a multisensory evening designed to unf
 old in rhythm with the rooftop setting. \n\nWhen: Tuesdays | September 29
 \, October 13\, October 27 \\(6:30 pm\\) \n\nPrice: $295 per guest\, wine
  selections prices separately \n\nReservations are available through Open
 Table: Raw & Rogue \n\nPre-paid reservations are required.
LOCATION:Appellation Healdsburg
URL:https://beelinerooftop.getbento.com/event/raw-rogue/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Liam St. John & Bridge City Sinners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T190000
UID:260910WluCVIlB70q_hL2z-aJphA
DESCRIPTION:Liam’s debut full-length project\, “stripped back” \\(Ju
 ne 2022\\) reached \\#1 in Top Blues Albums globally on Apple Music\, foll
 owed up by a successful nationwide tour that wrapped with a sold out show 
 in Music City\, USA. \n\nAt the crossroads of the blues and rock & roll\, 
 Liam St. John commands his truest form by combining lyrics that embody the
  blues with their piercing and painful truth\, and delivering a captivatin
 g performance with vibrancy true to the spirit of rock and roll. Liam floo
 ds the room with an electrifying energy\, washing over every stage he grac
 es. \n\nSt. John made his mark in Nashville after inking with King Pen Mus
 ic by way of Warner Chappell at the end of 2022. This is the blues-crooner
 ’s first publishing deal.  “I was knocked out by Liam‘s voice when I
  first heard it.  He is such a creative and unique artist with a vision li
 ke no other. His music brings a fresh new look on blues and rock in this w
 orld”\n\nLiam credits his foundation for singing to the legends he grew 
 up listening to. From Ray Charles to Etta James\, Sam Cooke\, Louis Armstr
 ong\, and Tracy Chapman\, the raw\, gritty\, blues-infused soul always sur
 faces in Liam’s songs and performances. \n\nLiam is managed by Aidan Cro
 wley with Legacy Content. //
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108686729?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
