UID:261012POu9sCihEEWYrzR0j9dq1w
DESCRIPTION:Bay Area favorites Pardon The Interruption return to The Stump
  to rock our socks off! Ska our skirts around! Reggae our regular attire..
 . into tiki-themed costumes!\n\nRoaring out of the fog-shrouded hills of S
 onoma and drowning out the chatter\, New Wave/Prog-Pop troubadours Pardon 
 the Interruption \\(aka PTI\\) are taking their place — asserting their 
 voice — in the storied musical conversation of the San Francisco Bay Are
 a. They deliver a high energy\, dance-inducing performance that will keep 
 you moving all night long!\n\nJoin us at WonderStump for this All Hallows'
  Eve Eve Gilligan's Island Themed par-TAY! Costumes are encouraged\, and y
 ou better believe the band will be dressed to impress up there on stage.\n
 \nAll Ages | $22.50 in advance | $25 at the door | Doors at 7pm\, live mus
 ic starts at 8
LOCATION:WonderStump!
