BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dead Man's Dinner
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261030T230000
UID:2609110RFypztdA0SHtcBaUD63wg
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the mist lies a secret devil's den where outlaws\, harl
 ots\, and the scalliest of wags gather to feast beneath the redwoods.\n\nT
 ake cover under timbered canopy of Rio Nido Lodge and step inside the sump
 tuous sanctuary of Dead Man’s Dinner—an immersive evening of decadent 
 dining and world-class cabaret just in time for Halloween weekend.\n\n​F
 or one night only\, be transported to a hidden heathen's haven\, alive wit
 h flickering candles and shadowed walkways while distant murmurs fill the 
 air. As the veil thins and Mischief Night unfolds\, you’ll gather under 
 the stars and indulge in a lavish feast paired with bespoke craft spirits 
 while roving scoundrels and spellbinding burlesque unfold all around you.\
 n\nOne part secret society. One part dinner theater. A wholly unforgettabl
 e experience: Dead Man’s Dinner invites you to leave the modern world be
 hind and join the Captain’s Court for one extraordinary night inspired b
 y pirate mythos\, dark fairytales\, and maritime lore.\n\nTickets on-sale 
 now. Capacity for this immersive experience is limited.\n\n**Dinner item
 s and signature cocktail menu to be announced.**\n\nFor questions and inqu
 iries regarding Dead Man's Dinner\, please call: (213) 650-0803 or email u
 s at deadmansledger@gmail.com
LOCATION:Rio Nido Lodge
URL:http://www.deadmansdinner.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
