UID:261008rhL5sfMJL0aYgqUelLc7HA
DESCRIPTION:Our Merlot revival continues with a celebration on National Me
 rlot Day! Join us at the historic Cameo Theater in St. Helena for Whitehal
 l Lane’s private screening of the iconic film *Sideways*. Of course\, th
 ere will be Merlot (and Pinot\, too!)\, plus a special introduction and po
 st-film Q&A with the book’s author\, Rex Pickett. \n\nPlease arrive at 
 the theater at 1 p.m. to enjoy a glass of Merlot (or Pinot\, or both!)\, g
 rab some popcorn\, and find your seat - all included with your ticket. Rex
  will introduce the film and sign books before the screening. Afterward\, 
 he’ll welcome guests to hit him with their fun\, hard-hitting questions 
 while enjoying another sip of Whitehall Lane wine. \n\nCome for the cult 
 classic\, stay for the wine\, and make a day of it with Rex and Whitehall 
 Lane.
