DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T160000
UID:260922jualAqY4Q0CAUN9vCFY2bA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the timeless sophistication and witty charm of one 
 of America’s greatest songwriters in this spectacular Cole Porter tribut
 e show. From unforgettable romantic ballads to sparkling\, upbeat show tun
 es\, this revue will showcase brilliant arrangements of Porter’s most be
 loved Broadway and Hollywood classics\, such as “Night and Day\,” “L
 et’s Do It\,” and “So In Love.” Join us for a dazzling musical jou
 rney that celebrates the sweeping melodies and clever lyrics that defined 
 an era of glamour. Don’t miss this captivating performance brought to li
 fe by world-class performers —secure your tickets today for an unforgett
 able afternoon of music!
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/easy-to-love-a-cole-porter-tribute-2/
