 right time to get native & climate-appropriate plantings in the ground bef
 ore our winter season arrives!\n\nTogether\, we’ll create a water-wise l
 andscape that will build habitat and bring beauty to the school community 
 for years to come.\n\nNOTE: All are welcome \\(including children with adu
 lt supervision\\)\, and no experience is needed\n\nCome for some\, or come
  for all—we will gather rain or shine!\n\nWe'll provide:\n\n-FREE Lunch 
 & Snacks\n\n-Instruction & tools\n\n-A fun day with the Petaluma and campu
 s community\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!\n\nHave questions? Rea
 ch out to us anytime by email to codyd@dailyacts.org or by phone at \\(707
 \\) 696-4609
