DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261107T213000
UID:261009WUXcdatX5kKchzQblF3AjA
DESCRIPTION:Discover Sonoma Valley after sunset at  Dinner & the Dark Sky 
 at St. Francis Winery \, an unforgettable evening where fine wine\, inspir
 ed cuisine\, and the wonders of the night sky come together. Hosted at St.
  Francis Winery\, the experience begins in the Grand Dining Room with a th
 oughtfully crafted dinner by Executive Chef Peter Janiak\, expertly paired
  with St. Francis artisan wines. The intimate setting invites guests to re
 lax\, savor each course\, and enjoy warm Wine Country hospitality. After d
 inner\, guests head outdoors for a guided stargazing experience led by loc
 al astronomy experts from Night Sky Adventure. Using professional telescop
 es\, you'll explore star clusters\, glowing nebulae\, and distant galaxies
  while learning about the night sky. Blending culinary excellence\, award-
 winning wines\, and celestial discovery\, this event offers a truly unique
  experience.
LOCATION:St. Francis Winery & Vineyards
