  the Sunshine of My Life\," "Lazy Day\," "Love Me\," "Close to You\," and 
 "Ain't Misbehavin'." The Chorus is directed by Deborah Benedict\, who uses
  her extensive musical training to conduct our uniquely American style of 
 four-part acapella harmony.Our guest entertainment will be COMMON THREAD\,
  an accomplished barbershop quartet who sing with San Francisco’s amazin
 g Fog City Singers. In addition\, 'TIL DAWN\, the renowned chorus of stude
 nts from Marin County High Schools skillfully directed by Austin Willacy w
 ill perform.The show takes place at the Marin Center Showcase Theater on S
 unday\, November 8th\, 2026\, at 2:00 P.M. Afterwards\, you are cordially 
 invited to a traditional Afterglow at Mountain Mike's Pizza\, 2100 4th Str
 eet\, San Rafael! Learn more about our chorus at marinbarbershopchorus.org
 .Marin Center Showcase Theatre20 Ave of the FlagsSan Rafael\, CA 94903
