 creening. - Lifestyle & Specialized Interventions Case studies and a culin
 ary workshop where you will actively build a healthy meal and learn tips y
 ou can share with your patients. - Technology and Lifestyle Medicine Eleva
 te your Practice with Expert-Led Lectures\, Interactive Workshops & Live C
 ooking Demos The day will culminate with a series of applied case presenta
 tions and Q&A with the experts\, offering a deep dive into real-world appl
