 , and so much more! Outdoor vendors set up on the 600 block of Marin Stree
 t\, between Georgia and Virginia Streets and additional vendors\, activiti
 es\, and arts and culture happenings are all throughout the entire downtow
 n area. Join our email newsletter at vallejoartwalk.org to learn more deta
