DESCRIPTION:Chill out every Friday night with DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie
  spinning live vibes in The Lounge!\n\nFRIDAY NIGHTS IN THE LOUNGE DJ Oso 
 Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Música Urbana Friday nigh
 ts go late at Barrel Proof Lounge.\n\nEvery Friday at 10 PM\, DJ Oso Perez
  & DJ Doc Boogie take over the lounge with a late-night mix of Hip Hop\, R
 eggaeton and Música Urbana \, keeping the front room moving into the nigh
 t. Oso is back behind the decks at Barrel Proof\, but this time we're swit
 ching things up. The focus is Hip Hop\, Reggaeton and Latin urban sounds 
 — with Oso and Doc Boogie working the room and keeping the party moving 
 all night.\n\nAnd there's more happening under the same roof.\n\nStart you
 r night with Friday Night Comedy in the Main Room\, then at 10 PM Barrel P
 roof splits into two completely different late-night parties:\n\n THE LOU
 NGE — 10 PM DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músi
 ca Urbana Dancing\, drinks and late-night Friday energy.\n\n THE BIG STAG
 E — 10 PM Late Night Karaoke Grab the mic and take over the Barrel Proof
  stage.\n\nMove between the rooms. Dance for a while. Sing something quest
 ionable. Grab another drink. Repeat as necessary.\n\nEVERY FRIDAY NIGHT  
 DJs start at 10 PM  Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Ave • Downtown Sa
 nta Rosa  DJ Oso Perez & DJ Doc Boogie  Hip Hop • Reggaeton • Músic
 a Urbana  Late Night Karaoke in the Main Room  21+\n\nCome for comedy. S
 tay for the party.\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge Comedy • Live Music • Karaok
 e • DJs • Events\n\nDowntown Santa Rosa
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-nights-in-the-lounge-w-dj-oso-pere
